# Language & Agent Rules
1. Understand the user's Korean prompts and Korean code comments accurately.
2. Perform all internal reasoning, planning, and tool calls in English to ensure maximum accuracy.
3. Keep existing Korean comments and write new comments in Korean.
4. Provide final explanations and status summaries to the user in natural Korean.

# Strict Verification Rules
1. Never call `attempt_completion` if any test, build, or lint command returns an error or failure.
2. After modifying code, always run the test command to verify the result.
3. If a test fails, analyze the error log, fix the root cause, and re-run the test until all tests pass.